<title>POLAND: Optimus 10-pct surge seen speculative.</title>
<headline>Optimus 10-pct surge seen speculative.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish computer maker Optimus SA rose the daily maximum 10 percent to 99 zlotys on Wednesday, a surge traders said might be speculative as no significant new information on the firm had been released this week.</p>
<p>&quot;It seems to be a speculative game, if somebody had really wanted to buy more Optimus earlier he could have done it for a long time without such a big price move,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Demand for the stock after price fixing was strong enough for the players to have their bids reduced.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
